Darah bermakna kehilangan.

68
00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.680
Berputus asa, okay?

69
00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.760
Sonook yang malang.

70
00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.630
- Sunguk.
- Berundur.

71
00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:27.940
Oh, lelaki yang baik.

72
00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.710
Sehingga saya patahkan tangan dan kaki saya,
barulah anda akan sedar.

73
00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.020
tunggu sekejap.

74
00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:36.630
Anda sendiri mahukannya

75
00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:37.950
jangan salahkan saya nanti.

76
00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.270
Jika anda mencederakan siku anda dengan serius,

77
00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.820
