Wah!

80
00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.940
Oh bagus!

81
00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:49.080
saya dah beritahu awak

82
00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.290
Jika anda menyentuh tekak saya lagi, saya akan membunuh anda.

83
00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:16.880
Hei.

84
00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.240
Saya memberi amaran kepada awak.

85
00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.590
Anda lebih baik tidak kos lagi
