atau saya?

124
00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:30.520
Fikirkan tentang ayah anda!

125
00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.160
Kalau tak nak belajar, tinggalkan.

126
00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:39.100
OK.

127
00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.070
Hei Kim Eugyeom!

128
00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:51.580
Kim Eugyom.

129
00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.780
Macam mana dia tiba-tiba bangun pergi
di tengah-tengah kelas?

130
00:16:58.720 --> 00:16:59.650
kenapa?

131
00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:01.520
Kenapa?!

132
00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.790
Cikgu sendiri suruh saya keluar.

133
00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:11.520
Jadi apa, anda hanya berkata "okay"
dan segera pergi?

134
00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.440
Awak kata belajar berdikari.

135
00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.470
Dan saya fikir itu betul.

136
00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:21.000
Gred saya telah meningkat

137
00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:22.780
dan saya memutuskan bahawa saya boleh belajar sendiri.

138
00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.450
Kim Eugyom.

139
00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.290
Adakah anda bersikap kurang ajar kepada saya sekarang?

140
00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:39.630
Tidak.

141
00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:42.600
Saya dengan jelas berkata apabila anda berpindah.

142
00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:45.870
Bahawa anda berdiri di tepi jurang.

143
00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.710
Anda akan melarikan diri setiap kali
Bilakah masalah timbul?

144
00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:54.940
Tidak.

145
00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:59.380
